ven-names></name><name><surname>Iwata</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Miura</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of high-molecular-weight sodium hyaluronate on experimental osteoarthrosis induced by the resection of rabbit anterior cruciate ligament</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>1994</year><volume>298</volume><fpage>296</fpage><lpage>304</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8118990</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hauser</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Hauser RA, Hauser MA, Pottinger K</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Answers to common questions about prolotherapy</article-title><source>Prolo Your Pain Away</source><year>1998</year><edition>1</edition><publisher-name>Oak Park, IL: Beulah Land Press</publisher-name><fpage>47</fpage><lpage>66</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Peyron</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intraarticular hyaluronan injections in the treatment of osteoarthritis: state-of-the-art review</article-title><source>J Rheumatol Suppl</source><year>1993</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>10</fpage><lpage>15</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8410878</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reeves</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Hassanein</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Randomized prospective double-blind placebo-controlled study of dextrose prolotherapy for knee osteoarthritis with or without ACL laxity</article-title><source>Altern Ther Health Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</v